id: super-kaioken-vermilion-explosion
name: Vermilion Explosion
order: 3
slot: burst
description: >
  In a brilliant burst of scarlet, your power explodes, multiplying rapidly in power.
text: >
  Vermilion Explosion: In a brilliant burst of scarlet, your power explodes, multiplying rapidly in power.
  (1)-[Triggered/Transform]: Use the Power Up Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, reduce the Life Point Cost for each Grade of Super Kaioken to 0 until the end of your turn.

---

# Burst Limit: entering it, ticked with Apply effects on its card (Scarlet Multiplier's way, the user's 2026-11-21: as it is activated) - the
# Life Point Cost 0 till the end of your turn from then (Multiplied Power's `vermilion`), and the Power Up's button on that card, out of
# sequence.
[triggered/transform, 1/encounter, outOfSequence, effect 1]
vermilion.stacks += 1;
expires(vermilion, turn);
offerOneOf(power-up);
